{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_032_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca828b92dabb1442652ef0ca980136c5e030487cfd88d6b9937e39ce4c7d52a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21670f77a9ff1b89f71b10cea96d1070ad25ea0df6a227f6620fc885ca7e538e",
      "text": "今天去了将棋俱乐部真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f116710bcf95a21edcaed3841158d64f6798e86221a9ab6e8dd6164b02d0244",
      "text": "下将棋的直央君充满了自信，\n超级帅气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:405ee3acdab7a8211724fcb3f8ff9c455dfa6a4dd08ca2a74b56c3f2db74f235",
      "text": "谢、谢谢夸奖……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e65addadaad3b4579517fee30985a682a28383a3bb494c278125c2c72c732466",
      "text": "……说起来，●●●●プロデューサー为什么\n会在将棋俱乐部附近呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7bf31e8e630d86edd6525bd659ab2b2cf361250924ddfa78f11d299204bdf8",
      "text": "因为我想着去这附近的一家店，\n给大家买もふもふえん的慰劳品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cae683a79d1e207992163fcdb4bcc52ae9c513e3faf157fef2abd4903387b606",
      "text": "能遇到直央君真是太好了。看了今天的这局棋，\n我想到了一个想让你尝试的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c175c14d17a45b6d1592ba3ef0e562dfa89edb1b0c537e2bc82e57e5f6cb3ee7",
      "text": "诶，工作吗……？\n我能做得到吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c47fabbfdd41eaa45fdb81e9c4a9ef40cd5094f355c63c2e4ba346b6afe8876",
      "text": "是的，当然可以。对局中的直央君，\n非常帅气哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb48f455cdd2c5d4f766c01cf290482fe0bbe555e7d2d427c7928455378f97bf",
      "text": "是、是这样吗……？那个，\n为了回应您的期待，我会努力的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:566dc810823bdfe8a027c9568c2ccebafcb8e83823a2d3fd4d5c7977327094a6",
      "text": "买好慰劳品之后，我们先回趟事务所吧。\n在练习开始前，我想跟你聊聊这份工作的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_032nao_01_1_2_032_01:1_2_032_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c14ab1619beb206b6444098878686b38b65aabe05517add58d5b0432a2d4743",
      "text": "好的……！请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
